308 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Software Engineering \055 Technical Assignment\n\240\nBusiness focus\072\n\nIn order to comply to the customer protection act\054 any credit institution in Finland must assess customer\031s credit worthiness on a fair\054 common and transparent ground\054 to prevent households from taking on too much debt\056 The Finnish Tax Administration\031s Incomes Register Unit controls and provides the information on the Positive Credit Register\056 \n\nHigh level requirement\072\nIt must be possible to fetch the credit extract information from the Positive Credit Register on the consumer with a financing need\056\nIt must be possible to view the detail credit extract  information of the consumer for all the instances fetched from the Positive Credit Register\056\nIt must be possible to monitor and report on the consumer financing requests  for the consumers with \030voluntary credit ban\031 option activated\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 307 0 R
     /Pg 302 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

